claude: true
prompt: |
  Drain the Dist-Zilla-PluginBundle-Author-GETTY karr board. This repo is the
  [@Author::GETTY] plugin bundle itself — the release/CI machinery every other
  GETTY dist inherits, dogfooded on its own source via [Bootstrap::lib]. Delegate
  behavior-relevant code (configure(), the attribute surface, the
  @Author::GETTY::Docker subsection, GiteaMeta, .github/actions/dzil-test) to the
  dist-zilla-pluginbundle-author-getty-worker agent, tests to
  dist-zilla-pluginbundle-author-getty-test-writer, and release audits to
  dist-zilla-pluginbundle-author-getty-release-checker; follow
  .claude/rules/dist-zilla-pluginbundle-author-getty-rules.md. Never release —
  a release here reaches every consuming dist. Cross-repo work is a ticket on the
  other repo's board (e.g. ../p5-dist-zilla-plugin-docker-api), never a direct edit.
